            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this paper, we give some sharper refinements and generalizations of inequalities related to Shafer-Fink's inequality for the inverse sine function stated in Theorems 1, 2, and 3 of Bercu (Math. Probl. Eng. 2017: Article ID 9237932, 2017).</AbstractText>
